        "r": 543.303,
        "b": 371.3043344167462
      },
      "content": "The door choke is removed by unfastening the sixteen M8 hex nuts. On refitting the door choke, ensure the studs are positioned correctly in the centre of the hole and not resting on the shoulder of the stud. The nuts should be retightened diagonally in the following sequence to 2.1 Nm.",
