        }
      ],
      "page": 76,
      "chunk_hint": "section_start",
      "semantic_role": "overview",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0995",
      "reading_order": 1252,
      "section": "Refitting the door assembly",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.994000000000085,
        "t": 145.98301953124997,
        "r": 500.079,
        "b": 137.5353344167462
      },
      "content": " Holding the door squarely against the cavity, the hinge nuts and bolts should be torqued up to 3.5Nm.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1250",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_6",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_6",
          "title": "6 Replacing components"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1250",
          "title": "Refitting the door assembly"
        }
      ],
      "page": 76,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0996",
      "reading_order": 1253,
      "section": "Refitting the door assembly",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.976,
        "t": 133.14001953125,
        "r": 448.22099999999995,
        "b": 124.69233441674623
      },
      "content": " Apply Loctite to the door skin bolts and screws, which should then be torqued up to 1Nm.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1250",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_6",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_6",
          "title": "6 Replacing components"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1250",
          "title": "Refitting the door assembly"
        }
      ],
      "page": 76,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0997",
      "reading_order": 1254,
      "section": "Refitting the door assembly",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.95799999999997,
        "t": 120.54001953124998,
        "r": 534.729,
        "b": 99.13233441674618
      },
      "content": " Check that the door seal firmly meets the cavity frame all the way around once closed. A poor sealing door can cause issues with the oven's operation.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1250",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_6",
      "section_level": 2,
